{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:18 2026-10-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:18 2026-10-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:18 2026-10-30 HKT</p><img alt=\"工人清醒送院治理。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/cf3783d2d550c1dc8320e1212e6c883c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-30_at_11_49_32.jpeg\"/><p>今（30日）早上10時54分，西貢蠔涌路一名男工人，修理一部有挖斗的小型搬運車後，在試車期間，挖斗翻側，壓著他的腳部，他自行報警求助，消防接報到場，將他救出，事主兩腳擦傷，清醒送將軍澳醫院治理，警方將事件列工業意外跟進調查。</p><img alt=\"傷者清醒送院。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dcd7cc8ee67d0a14132d29aa4d312d61/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-30_at_11_49_32_0.jpeg\" title=\"傷者清醒送院。楊偉亨攝\"/><p>傷者清醒送院。楊偉亨攝</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T04:41:44.409581+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T04:18:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:22:32.571308+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T04:38:41.267979+00:00","content_hash":"d028a8c89802c87944185292dcc7ede14a71a8645e9db7b6019cbcc2b81bd6c9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}